OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is a replica Spanish galleon
OL,4,Ain the west of Scotland?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNot-for-profit organisation Nao
OL,7,FVictoria Foundation are behind the 55m
OL,8,Flong boat, which was constructed in
OL,9,F2009 and is manned by cadets from the
OL,10,FSpanish navy.
